  "question": {
    "text": "A green light is incident from the water to the air - water interface at the critical angle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><msub><mi>&#952;</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mfenced></math>.&nbsp;Select the <strong>correct</strong> statement.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "GvzDO",
      "text": "The entire spectrum of visible light will come out of the water at an angle of 90<sup>o</sup> to the normal",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "pL37M",
      "text": "The spectrum of visible light whose frequency is less than that of green light will come out to the air medium",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "61Epr",
      "text": "The spectrum of visible light whose frequency is more than that of green light will come out to the air medium",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "l6c23",
      "text": "The entire spectrum of visible light will come out of the water at various angles to the normal",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math> <mrow> <mtext>sin</mtext> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <msub> <mi>&#952;</mi> <mtext>c</mtext> </msub> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mi>&#956;</mi> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/7e01ca19-c8ac-4f94-838c-de049f5ddef7-image.png\" style=\"width: 232px; height: 200px;\" /></p><p>For greater wavelength (i.e lesser frequency) <mi>&mu;</mi> is less So, <math> <mrow> <msub> <mi>&#952;</mi> <mtext>c</mtext> </msub> </mrow> </math> would be more. So, they will not suffer reflection and come out at angles less than <math> <mrow> <msup> <mtext>90</mtext> <mo>&#8728;</mo> </msup> </mrow> </math>.</p>",
